97
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:20,000
And the five love languages are touch, words of affirmation, acts of service, gifts, and quality time.

98
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:24,000
So maybe as you hear those, you can kind of naturally think like,

99
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:26,000
